add('exit_timing',283,'so many Moneth, Weeks or Dayes','timing_method',['The preceding sixth-house unfortunate-planet sign-exit configuration applies.','The question asks when or how long before the disease alters.'],'Lilly directs counting how many degrees the malevolent planet lacks before leaving the sign, then judging that many months, weeks, or days according to the sign’s nature and quality.',uncertainty=['No determinate month/week/day selection rule is supplied in this passage.','No rounding or partial-degree rule is supplied.'],dependencies=['malefic_exit'])
