add('hylegical_oppressed',[289,290],'by a divine miracle as it were','death_testimony',['The five hylegical places at birth are oppressed at decumbiture.','The ascendant lord is also oppressed.'],'Judge death immediately to follow.',exceptions=['Unless reception intervenes between the Infortunes and the Fortunes interject comfortable aspects; then the sick may escape, by a divine miracle as it were.'],uncertainty=['The five hylegical places and exact oppression test are not defined in this passage.','The grammatical grouping of reception and Fortune intervention is not resolved into executable logic.'],logic='Oppression of five natal hylegical places at decumbiture AND L1 oppression; exception preserves source “unless reception ... and the Fortunes ...” wording without a definitive parse.')
