add('l8_seventh_cadent',291,'and more certaine','death_testimony',['Eighth lord is in seventh.','Moon and ascendant lord are cadent and infected with ill aspects of Infortunes.'],'This is a death testimony in the section’s sequence, more certain if one malevolent is eighth lord or is in eighth.',uncertainty=['The sentence omits an independent finite outcome before its certainty clause; outcome is inherited from local death-argument context.'])
