add('moon_besieged',292,'ill Omens of health','danger',['Moon is besieged by Infortunes, OR between Sun and Mars, OR between Sun and Saturn.'],'These are ill omens of health.',uncertainty=['Besiegement is not assigned a numeric span in this passage.'])
add('beams_departing',292,'departing from Combustion','staged_progression',['The person falls sick while Moon is under Sun’s beams, identified here as departing combustion.'],'The disease shall increase until Moon has passed Sun’s opposition. If Moon then proves ill affected and comes to an ill aspect of eighth lord, it threatens death; otherwise the person escapes.',exceptions=['After the specified stage, absence of the ill-affected/ill-eighth-aspect branch yields the explicit escape alternative.'],uncertainty=['No orb for beams/combustion or ill aspect is supplied in this passage.'],logic='At onset Moon under beams/departing combustion -> increase until passed Sun opposition; THEN IF Moon ill affected AND comes to ill aspect of L8 -> threatens death; ELSE escape.')
