issue('attributed_variant','Moon conjunct Jupiter is elsewhere a good recovery argument; some say Moon conjunct Saturn or Jupiter gives no escape unless Saturn retrograde and Jupiter direct.','The anonymous attribution and interaction of the printed or with the two-planet exception are not resolved.',['moon_jupiter_any','some_say_saturn_jupiter'],'Retain the attributed variant and independent Jupiter-recovery rule, with no invented precedence.',origin='source_defined_content')
